# NOTE: prisma/migrations is deliberately NOT excluded.
#
# `prisma migrate deploy` resolves migration SQL by reading the migrations
# directory off disk; it does not embed them in the Prisma client. Excluding
# them (as this file previously did) produces an image that builds and starts
# but then reports "No migration found in prisma/migrations" and leaves the
# production schema empty. The Prisma schema itself is still required and is
# copied in.
